    "impact": {
      "summary": "The bill creates \u00a75308 authorizing FTA grants to urbanized areas for transit operating, planning, security, and safety. It sets an 80% federal share for operating aid and requires transit recipients (for example, New York MTA) to certify they will maintain non\u2011Federal operating and security spending.",
